OL,3,GNEWSA#136k grant aims to expose
OL,4,A'unrecognised heritage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to "reveal the history and
OL,7,Fheritage of one of the country's most
OL,8,Fsignificant historical landscapes" has
OL,9,Fbeen announced by Historic England.
OL,11,FThe organisation has awarded a #136,356
OL,12,Fgrant to charities York Archaeology and
OL,13,Fthe Yorkshire Wildlife Trust (YWT), for
OL,14,Fa project in the Yorkshire Wolds,
OL,15,Finvolving people who would "not
OL,16,Fnormally be involved in heritage
OL,17,Fprojects".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
