OL,3,GNEWSA#136k grant aims to expose
OL,4,A'unrecognised heritage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 68 sq mile (176 sq km) area of the
OL,7,FWolds was being mapped by Historic
OL,8,FEngland, it said, with new landscapes
OL,9,Ffrom prehistoric times to World War Two
OL,10,Fdiscovered.
OL,12,FThe chalk upland's "unique geography
OL,13,Fmakes this a nationally important
OL,14,Fwildlife-rich area", said Jon Traill,
OL,15,Ffrom YWT.
